<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 23.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 23.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Monday, June 23:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,693.20 (1,697.30)	CHF  1,176.30 (1,174.20)</p>
<p>    DEM    980.32 (981.38)	  GBP  2,796.80 (2,785.30)</p>
<p>    ATS    139.35 (139.37)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Friday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $ 8.44 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$ 7.82 million</p>
<p>    Total turnover  $16.26 million ($27.91 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
